        },
        {
          "text": "ani gara namoota duriitti, warra boolla buʼan wajjin boolla sin buusa. Ani akkuma diigama duriitti, warra boolla buʼan wajjin akka ati lafa jala jiraattu sin godha; atis lammata hin deebitu yookaan biyya warra lubbuun jiranii keessatti iddoo hin argattu.",
          "type": "text",
